LANTERN KNIGHT — Cooper Barrel

10 frames, fixed 512 x 576 RGBA canvas, 850 ms, one-shot with persistent final state.
Use cooper_barrel_clip.json for exact durations, atlas rectangles and pivot.
Pivot: (256,450) measured from top-left. Unity bottom-left normalized: (0.5,0.21875).
A single generic loot_release event occurs on frame 04 at 260 ms.
Spawn the game's independently selected rewards on that event. There are no baked rewards.
Start at states/intact.png; play once on interaction; hold states/empty_persistent.png.
Do not loop the interaction or emit loot_release more than once per interactable.
Import all frames at the same scale and pivot, with Full Rect meshes, bilinear filter,
no mipmaps, and lossless texture settings. All frames share one anchor.

Original approved artwork is retained unchanged in the separate source kit.
Runtime cels are genuinely transparent with clean straight-alpha edges.
Generated native cel sheet is 1536 x 1024, with 384 x 512 cells; no upscaling.
Runtime canvas includes transparent margins and is not artwork upscaling.
